I feint toward the leading wolf, but my foot slips on the packed snow. The beast twists and clamps its jaws shut on my right thigh, dragging me down into the powder. 

I try to stab downward, but the second wolf pins my weapon arm to the frozen ground. The heavy jaws close over my throat, crushing my windpipe in a rush of cold dark silence.

}
